      "summaries": {
        "en": "LiteLLM is a unified Python SDK and proxy server that solves the complexity of managing multiple large language model APIs by providing a standardized OpenAI-compatible interface. Its technical innovation lies in abstracting away vendor-specific differences through intelligent routing and format translation, allowing developers to switch between 100+ LLM providers with minimal code changes. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for OpenAI's client to experiment with different models, implement cost tracking across providers, or deploy it as a production gateway with built-in load balancing and guardrails for reliable LLM operations.",
        "zh": "LiteLLM是一个统一的Python SDK和代理服务器，解决了管理多个大语言模型API的复杂性，通过提供标准化的OpenAI兼容接口简化开发流程。其技术核心在于通过智能路由和格式转换抽象不同供应商的API差异，让开发者只需少量代码修改即可在100多个LLM提供商间灵活切换。你可以直接将其作为OpenAI客户端的替代品来实验不同模型，实现跨供应商的成本追踪，或部署为生产环境网关，利用内置的负载均衡和安全护栏构建可靠的LLM应用系统。",
        "es": "LiteLLM is a unified Python SDK and proxy server that solves the complexity of managing multiple large language model APIs by providing a standardized OpenAI-compatible interface. Its technical innovation lies in abstracting away vendor-specific differences through intelligent routing and format translation, allowing developers to switch between 100+ LLM providers with minimal code changes. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for OpenAI's client to experiment with different models, implement cost tracking across providers, or deploy it as a production gateway with built-in load balancing and guardrails for reliable LLM operations.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "litellm stands out for ai-gateway, anthropic, and azure-openai in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "LiteLLM is a unified Python SDK and proxy server that solves the complexity of managing multiple large language model APIs by providing a standardized OpenAI-compatible interface. Its technical innovation lies in abstracting away vendor-specific differences through intelligent routing and format translation, allowing developers to switch between 100+ LLM providers with minimal code changes. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for OpenAI's client to experiment with different models, implement cost tracking across providers, or deploy it as a production gateway with built-in load balancing and guardrails for reliable LLM operations.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
