      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude Subconscious is a TypeScript library that enhances Claude Code's reasoning by adding persistent background processing capabilities, addressing the limitation of single-turn interactions in AI coding assistants. It implements a subconscious-like layer where Claude can maintain context across sessions, process information continuously, and recall previous work without explicit prompting. Developers can integrate it into their Claude Code workflows to enable multi-step problem solving, maintain project context between coding sessions, and build more sophisticated AI-assisted development environments where the assistant remembers technical decisions and patterns.",
        "zh": "Claude Subconscious 是一个 TypeScript 库，为 Claude Code 添加了持久化背景处理层，以克服传统 AI 编程助手单轮交互的局限。它使 Claude 能够跨会话保持上下文，持续处理信息，并在无需明确提示时回忆先前工作。该库模拟人类潜意识机制，帮助 AI 记忆项目决策、编码模式和技术背景。开发者可将其集成至工作流，实现多步骤问题解决、跨会话项目维护，从而构建更智能的开发环境，使编程助手真正记住用户的技术思路与习惯。",
        "es": "Claude Subconscious is a TypeScript library that enhances Claude Code's reasoning by adding persistent background processing capabilities, addressing the limitation of single-turn interactions in AI coding assistants. It implements a subconscious-like layer where Claude can maintain context across sessions, process information continuously, and recall previous work without explicit prompting. Developers can integrate it into their Claude Code workflows to enable multi-step problem solving, maintain project context between coding sessions, and build more sophisticated AI-assisted development environments where the assistant remembers technical decisions and patterns.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-subconscious gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claude Subconscious is a TypeScript library that enhances Claude Code's reasoning by adding persistent background processing capabilities, addressing the limitation of single-turn interactions in AI coding assistants. It implements a subconscious-like layer where Claude can maintain context across sessions, process information continuously, and recall previous work without explicit prompting. Developers can integrate it into their Claude Code workflows to enable multi-step problem solving, maintain project context between coding sessions, and build more sophisticated AI-assisted development environments where the assistant remembers technical decisions and patterns.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/letta-ai/claude-subconscious for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
